# The signing key for the dApp Store package — NEVER committed, in any
# form. The store refuses an update signed with a different key, so losing
# it means the listing can never be updated; leaking it means anyone can
# publish as us. It lives in the operator's password manager
# (docs/guide/MOBILE.md §4).
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem

# Passwords for the key: environment variables only (webshell.env.example).
.env
*.env
!webshell.env.example

# Build output and Gradle caches of the generated Android project.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/local.properties
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
